# Testing Guidelines

- Prefer fixtures for setup/teardown; keep tests declarative and minimal.
- Replace loops and conditionals with `@pytest.mark.parametrize` for clarity (no-loop-in-tests).
- Assert one thing per test where practical; name tests descriptively.
- Use `app.dependency_overrides` to inject or remove dependencies in FastAPI tests.
- Ensure TestClient runs lifespan by using context managers or test-level fixtures.
